# v5 日检 + 日报(roadmap P0.3 监控告警最小集)—— 每天 09:00 北京时间由
# openclaude-v5-daily.timer 触发 scripts/v5-daily-check.sh:计费突增/免单率/
# 活跃度/错误日志统计,无告警也发一条日报站内信给 boss。
# 自监(方案 §2.3-3):脚本自身崩/超时/非 0 退出时,OnFailure 拉起 alert-fail 模板,
# 对本单元做 outbox+inbox 双写告警；脚本与依赖 unit 由官方 --install-monitor 同包安装。
[Unit]
Description=OpenClaude v5 daily check (billing anomalies + daily report)
After=network.target postgresql.service
Wants=postgresql.service
OnFailure=openclaude-v5-alert-fail@%n.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=root
WorkingDirectory=/opt/openclaude/v5-monitor/current
Environment="PATH=/root/.bun/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin"
ExecStart=/usr/bin/bash /opt/openclaude/v5-monitor/current/v5-daily-check.sh
TimeoutStartSec=300
